# AsahiLocker boot tripwire: after every dnf transaction, record /boot and the
# EFI partition, so an update that does not go through kernel-install (GRUB,
# shim) is not reported as a change nobody made if the machine crashes before
# its next clean shutdown. Records only on a boot whose check came back clean.
# Read by libdnf5-plugin-actions; boot-tripwire/install.sh puts it in place
# only when that plugin is installed.
post_transaction::::/usr/local/sbin/asahilocker-boot-tripwire record --auto dnf
